enging the solutions and the greater the time pressure becomes. Along the way, look out for shortcuts and secret exits, and unlock next stages!\n\nThe elasticity of Umihara\u2019s fishing line sets the apart from other games, giving unprecedented levels of mobility and discovery. Tightening the line or giving lots of slack can be the difference between success or failure. The elastic nature of the fishing line allows the player to stretch down to otherwise unreachable areas or be catapulted upwards.", "short_description": "Umihara Kawase is a girl who uses a fishing hook as a grappling hook. You\u2019ll need quick reflexes to swing your way through the branching surreal environments. Use your brains to figure out the best way through. Along the way, look out for shortcuts and secret exits, and unlock next stages!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "http://www.saizensen.co.jp/kawase/sayonara_gear_vr01.pdf", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "http://www.saizensen.co.jp/kawase/sayonara_gear_vr01.pdf", "publisher_name": "Studio Saizensen Co.,Ltd.", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "http://www.saizensen.co.jp/kawase/sayonara_gear_vr01.pdf", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": null, "context_topics": [], "external_subscription_type": null, "genres": ["ACTION", "PUZZLE", "CASUAL"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": null, "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en", "ja", "en_GB", "fr", "de", "it", "pt_BR", "ru"], "supported_input_devices": ["GAMEPAD"], "supported_player_modes": [], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "417926303453049"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 4, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1214903121951395"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "322446511524966"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED"